[section, $md:
    # HTML components

    Templates produce HTML strings, while const functions build reusable
    component values. An entry explicitly sends the final page content and
    dependencies to the HTML builder.

    This pattern describes the intended component library design. Its Basic
    and Advanced examples are being developed in this section.
]

